3. Set up Docker:
   a. Create a `Dockerfile` in the root of your Cypress project with the following content:
      ```dockerfile
      FROM cypress/included:latest
      COPY cypress.json cypress/
      COPY cypress/plugins/index.js cypress/plugins/
      COPY cypress/support/index.js cypress/support/
      ```
   b. This `Dockerfile` will use the official Cypress Docker image and copy the necessary configuration files into the container.

